{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261125%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C54%E6%AD%B2%E8%A3%9D%E4%BF%AE%E5%B7%A5%E6%B6%89%E8%88%87%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%BA%E6%AE%98%E9%85%B7%E5%B0%8D%E5%BE%85%E7%8A%AC%E9%9A%BB-%E5%85%BC%E6%B6%89%E7%84%A1%E7%89%8C%E7%AE%A1%E6%9C%89%E6%8D%95%E7%8D%B8%E5%99%A8-%E8%A2%AB%E6%8E%A7%E5%85%A9%E7%BD%AA-%E5%87%861%E8%90%AC%E5%85%83%E4%BF%9D%E9%87%8B%E5%80%99%E8%A8%8A-863x1024.jpg\" width=\"863\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>54歲裝修工涉與他人在大埔馬窩路殘酷對待一隻狗，另涉沒有特別許可證而管有捕獸籠及22個捕獸夾，被控「殘酷對待動物」及「無特別許可證而管有狩獵器具」兩罪，案件今（25日）在粉嶺裁判法院首度提堂，被告暫毋須答辯，案件押後至明年2月3日再訊，被告獲准以1萬元保釋外出。</strong></p>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>被告温偉明（54歲，裝修工人）被控「殘酷對待動物」及「無特別許可證而管有狩獵器具」罪。</p>\n<p>控罪指，被告於2026年11月22日，在大埔馬窩路某屋外與男子黃月強及其他身分不詳的人殘酷地惡待一隻狗，因而導致該狗隻受到不必要的痛苦。他另被控於同日同地，沒有特別許可證行事下而管有狩獵器具（22個捕獸夾及一個捕獸籠）。</p>\n<p>法院：粉嶺裁判法院<br/>法官：署理主任裁判官香淑嫻<br/>被告：温偉明<br/>控罪：殘酷對待動物、無特別許可證而管有狩獵器具<br/>案件編號：FLCC2798/2026</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T13:23:58.929299+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":391,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T10:57:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T09:37:14.299120+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T13:17:20.598949+00:00","content_hash":"817c88a16e8ca30f4e084ec26b7f5f9c76a212c14abf0d6009c495dc70a42ea0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}